{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","焚羽天裁"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","持续消耗自身生命值，朝敌方阵营发射火焰。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择战场中轴线上的一个格子，塔琳会飞到该位置，随后向敌方阵营方向发射5格长度的火焰冲击，期间每秒消耗12.5%最大生命值和250点能量，对范围内敌人造成150% + 20% ATK伤害，并附带自身生命流失量170% + 5%的额外伤害，该额外伤害由命中的所有敌人分摊。\n能量耗尽时，塔琳会继续释放该技能，但每秒消耗的生命值提高至20%。该技能在范围内无敌人时立即结束。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":80,"end":86,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":107,"end":112,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":2,"end":7,"tooltip_key":"keyword:centralaxis"},{"start":76,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒对敌人的伤害提高至160% + 20% ATK，附带的额外伤害提高至生命流失量的190% + 5%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每秒对敌人的伤害提高至170% + 20% ATK，附带的额外伤害提高至生命流失量的210% + 5%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每秒对敌人的伤害提高至180% + 20% ATK，附带的额外伤害提高至生命流失量的230% + 5%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每秒对敌人的伤害提高至190% + 20% ATK，附带的额外伤害提高至生命流失量的250% + 5%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","流焰星舞"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，自身损失生命值时可为队友回复生命值；自身获得治疗时对敌人造成伤害。主动使用时，召唤天火对敌方造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，每当自身损失10%最大生命值，便会产生一道暖流，使最虚弱的其他友方英雄回复40% ATK生命值；每当自身回复10%最大生命值，便会产生一道激流，对最健康的敌人造成50% ATK伤害。\n主动使用时，消耗20%最大生命值，在敌方最密集区域召唤天火，对半径1格范围内造成200% + 10% ATK伤害，该伤害获得额外40 + 3点生命汲取。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":140,"end":146,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":162,"end":166,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":41,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"keyword:strongest"},{"start":85,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":136,"end":150,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，对敌人的伤害提升至215% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，对敌人的伤害提升至230% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，对敌人的伤害提升至240% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","不死鸟"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","每次被击败后化作一团火焰，期间缓缓回复生命值，生命值回复至一定值后可重生。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","塔琳每次被击败后化作一团火焰，火焰状态下不算作存活英雄，不会被敌人攻击，每秒恢复最大生命值的8%，且可以受到友军技能的影响。当自身生命值恢复到65%以上时将会重生，同时产生一次火焰爆炸，对2格内敌人造成150% + 10% ATK伤害并将其击退1格。塔琳每次重生，将会使自身在后续的火焰状态下永久降低33点受愈。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":105,"end":111,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":101,"end":115,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","后续每次重生所降低的受愈减少至32点。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","后续每次重生所降低的受愈减少至31点。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","后续每次重生所降低的受愈减少至30点。"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","消耗一定生命值可提高攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当自身消耗50%最大生命值，提升8%攻击力，最多提升32%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每当自身消耗50%最大生命值，提升9%攻击力，最多提升36%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每当自身消耗50%最大生命值，提升10%攻击力，最多提升40%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","不灭凤焰"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","强化布阵最靠前的友方英雄，使其持续对周围敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，为除自己外布阵最靠前的友方英雄赋予“不灭凤焰”，持续至战斗结束。“不灭凤焰”的携带者每秒会对相邻的敌人造成自身攻击力50%的伤害，并为自身恢复伤害量25%的生命。每当受“不灭凤焰”的携带者累计获得相当于自身攻击力500%的治疗时，便会在身旁产生一枚火种并将其吸收，并永久强化“不灭凤焰”，使该技能造成的伤害提高50%，最多叠加3次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“不灭凤焰”对附近敌人伤害提升至自身攻击力的55%，生命恢复提升至伤害量的30%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“不灭凤焰”对附近敌人伤害提升至自身攻击力的60%，生命恢复提升至伤害量的35%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","当“不灭凤焰”强化至最高层数后，当其携带者被击败时，将消耗全部“不灭凤焰”，使携带者化为一团火焰，并在3秒后以50%最大生命值重生。本效果每场战斗只能生效一次。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","首次被击败时，生命恢复的速度提升。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每次战斗首次被击败时，自身在火焰状态下生命恢复速度提高至每秒15%点生命值。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","赤羽之焰"]]}